:: Widgets Bailey Street Hunt [widget]

<<widget "baileyStreetHunt">>
	/* Rendered inline by <<eventsstreet>> when an overdue, aggressive Bailey corners the player in the street.
	No effects call here as the street passage already ran them. */
	<<if not $baileyHuntReturn>><<set $baileyHuntReturn to $passage>><</if>>
	<<endevent>>
	<<npc Bailey>><<person1>>
	<<generateRole 1 0 "thug">><<generateRole 2 0 "thug">>

	<<set _huntReason to (setup.inflation ? setup.inflation.baileyAggressionReason() : "")>>

	Bailey is already there, flanked by a <<person2>><<person>> and a <<person3>><<person>>, the three of them spreading across the pavement to cut off the street.
	The goons close in, herding you back until your shoulders meet a wall.
	Before you can bolt, the <<person2>><<person>> seizes one of your wrists and the <<person3>><<person>> the other, pinning your hands against the brick.
	<br><br>
	<<person1>>"You can't run from me," Bailey says.
	<<switch _huntReason>>
	<<case "loan">>
		"The bank's been bending my ear about what you owe them. They've made collecting it my problem, and I always solve my problems."
	<<case "inflation">>
		"I've heard all about that little fortune you've been hoarding. Did you really think keeping off the doorstep would make the rent disappear?"
	<<case "both">>
		"A fat purse you won't spend, and a bank screaming in my ear about your debt. You've turned yourself into my full-time job."
	<<default>>
		"You've kept me waiting long enough."
	<</switch>>
	<br><br>
	<<baileyRentFlavour>>
	"<span class="red">Pay up.</span>"
	<<babyRent>>
	<<set _loanSurcharge to (setup.hbsc and setup.hbsc.loanRentSurcharge ? setup.hbsc.loanRentSurcharge() : 0)>>
	<<bratTaxCalc>>
	<<set _rentTotal to ($rentMoney + ($babyRent or 0) + ($bratTax or 0) + _loanSurcharge)>>
	<<loanRentNotice>>
	<<if ((setup.inflation ? setup.inflation.rentPayable() : $money) + ($baileyDeposit or 0)) gte _rentTotal>>
		<<He>> holds out an open palm. "You owe me <<printmoney _rentTotal "red">>."
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Pay up|Street Bailey Hunt Pay]]>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		<<He>> nods. The goons turn out your pockets<<if $money gt 0>>, taking the <<printmoney $money "gold">> you're carrying<</if>>.
		<<if $hbsc and $hbsc.account and Number.isFinite($hbsc.account.deposit) and $hbsc.account.deposit gt 0>>
			<<baileyBankDraw `$hbsc.account.deposit`>>
		<</if>>
		It still isn't enough. <<His>> smile fades.<<gggtrauma>><<gstress>>
		<<if $money gt 0>><<money `-$money` "baileyRent">><</if>>
		<<set _huntBundle to ($rentTime lte -14 and not $bailey_confiscation and ($rentMoney or 0) gt 0) ? baileyConfiscationBundle(_rentTotal) : { items: [], total: 0 }>>
		<<if _huntBundle.items.length gt 0>>
			<<run baileyConfiscationApply(_huntBundle)>>
			<br><br>
			<<He>> takes out <<his>> phone and makes a short call without looking away from you. "The brat's room. Clear it out."
			<br><br>
			"My people are at the orphanage already," <<he>> says. "Your <<baileyConfiscationList>> will be out of that room before you get back.
			You have one week to pay up properly in my office before I pawn your junk off."
			<span class="red">They're taking your belongings!</span>
			<<set $rentTime to 7>><<set $rentDay to Time.weekDay>>
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		"Consider that a down payment. I'll find you again. I always do."
		<<His>> goons give your arms a final wrench before letting go.<<gpain>>
		/* Couldn't pay: give a day's reprieve so the hunt can't trap the player mid-street. */
		<<set $daily.baileyHuntBroke to true>>
		<<set $baileyRefusedToPay += 1>>
		<<trauma 12>><<stress 5>><<pain 15>>
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Next|$baileyHuntReturn]]>><<endevent>><<unset $baileyHuntReturn>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

:: Street Bailey Hunt Pay
<<effects>><<if not $baileyHuntReturn>><<set $baileyHuntReturn to "High Street">><</if>>
<<rentpay>>
The goons release your wrists at a flick of Bailey's hand. The three of them fold back into the crowd as if they'd never been there.
<br><br>
<<set $rentTime to 7>><<set $rentDay to Time.weekDay>>
<<link [[Next|$baileyHuntReturn]]>><<endevent>><<unset $baileyHuntReturn>><</link>>
<br>
